==English==

===Etymology===
Origin is attributed to authors of fan-fiction. OTP is simlar to a favorite pairing[a relationship usually sexual], but the author believes that no other pairing will be better for the characters. Authors that are really into their one true pairing with commonly hold out for the actual show to have that pairing.

===Noun===
# One True Pair (or Pairing).

